2	// - wmma 16x16x16 tensor-core matmuls (mma.sync.m16n8k16 under the hood)
3	// - cp.async double-buffered K/V tiles; padded row stride (136 bf16) makes
4	//   ldmatrix reads conflict-free
5	// - online softmax with P kept in registers: for wmma m16n16k16 the
6	//   accumulator fragment layout equals the matrix_a layout, so P is fed
7	//   straight into the PV matmul without a shared-memory round trip.
